OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FAnother mainly dry day with     
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some bright or      
OL,7,Fsunny spells, chance of some isolated  
OL,8,Fcoastal showers. Remaining rather cold 
OL,9,Fwith generally light winds.            
OL,11,CTonight:                               
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudy with a band of rain    
OL,14,Fmoving eastwards across the region,    
OL,15,Fthis could fall as freezing rain       
OL,16,Fbefore turning to snow over high       
OL,17,Fground. Winds will become increasingly 
OL,18,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
