OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand mostly dry through the period,     
OL,7,Fwith isolated showers on Thursday.     
OL,8,FWinds easing but feeling chilly away   
OL,9,Ffrom the coast, with temperatures      
OL,10,Fbelow average.                         
